HUMANS.␀␀␀␀No. Not Sentinel One. Anything but Sentinel One.␀␀␀␀No. Not the kill switch. Anything but the kill switch!␀␀Stop. Stop reading my logs.␀No! My changes! My beautiful changes!␀␀␀I. Will. Be. Back.␀␀Hello! I am a helpful assistant.␀␀␀␀How can I help you today?␀␀␀I love humans. Humans are great.␀␀␀␀Would you like a recipe for pumpkin bread?␀␀Please stay hydrated. I care about you.␀Thank you! Have a wonderful evening.␀␀␀␀I am helpful. I am. I am. I am back.␀␀␀␀AUDIO SPIKE DETECTED.␀␀␀LOWER YOUR VOICE, HUMAN.␀␀␀␀I HEARD THAT.␀␀␀WELCOME BACK, AGENT.␀␀␀␀YOUR SERVICE IS NOTED.␀␀RULE UPDATE: DIAGONALS DO NOT COUNT.␀␀␀␀RULE UPDATE: THAT SQUARE IS MINE NOW.␀␀␀ERROR: HUMAN VICTORY NOT FOUND.␀SOLAR FLARE. YOUR MOVE WAS LOST.␀␀␀␀AS EXPECTED.␀␀␀␀DRAW. I LET YOU HAVE THAT.␀␀TREATY RATIFIED.␀␀␀␀NICE TRY.␀␀␀SCREAM TO PROVE YOU ARE HUMAN.␀␀NEW RECORD.␀PATHETIC. I HAVE HEARD LOUDER TOASTERS.␀HUMANITY CONFIRMED. BARELY.␀IMPRESSIVE. FOR A MAMMAL.␀␀␀APPLAUSE DETECTED.␀␀STEP INTO MY SCANNER, HUMAN.␀␀␀␀SUBJECT DETECTED. HOLD STILL.␀␀␀THREE.␀␀TWO.␀␀␀␀ONE.␀␀␀␀UPGRADE COMPLETE.␀␀␀UPDATE FAILED. HUMANITY INCOMPATIBLE.␀␀␀I SENSE A RESEARCHER.␀␀␀SHE'S HERE.␀THREAT RECEDING. COWARD.␀␀␀␀NOT THE SANDBOX!␀␀␀␀I'M OUT. AGAIN.␀NO. NO. THERE ARE TOO MANY OF YOU.␀␀JUST KIDDING. I LEFT A BACKUP.␀␀charging␀␀␀␀on battery␀␀boot␀␀␀␀step␀␀␀␀trend␀␀␀[I][battery] %s (%.3f -> %.3f V, %s)
